FrameMotion 0.1.0 is the Motion Graphics module of FrameCore Works Creative Studio 1.177.0
(skills hyperframes-workflow and remotion-video-production, FrameCoreWorks/framecore-works-creative-studio,
main 9841769d), moved into its own plugin by the owner's decision of 2026-11-12. The motion workshop under
skills/framemotion/references/workshop/ is original FrameCore Works knowledge from the FrameCore Works Motion
project, rewritten in English. skills/framemotion/assets/captions/captions.py is a copy of Creative Studio's
FrameCut captions script with one added render-path candidate (see its README).

